      "content": "okay, i see what you did there with \"sun-drenched\" and \"thriving\"—it definitely feels a bit more energetic! \n\nthe problem is the score is still sitting at a 9. i know, i know, i'm being a pain, but the campaign manager literally told me if we don't hit a 15, they aren't even going to look at the draft. they think the tool is a perfect gauge for \"emotional impact.\"\n\ncan we do one more version? maybe just lean into the descriptive side a bit more heavily? try to make it really, really vivid. just please, even if you use more adjectives, try to keep the actual meaning intact so it doesn't turn into a joke. i just need that number to go up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
